# Moddy Arena: a creature wished into the arena fights the wave. In prep he makes a cat with the Apprentice on the
# arena's floor (a cat has no attack of its own: the arena gives it one), goes back to the prep room, presses the start
# button and fights nothing himself. Wave 1 is husks, which daylight does not burn; he stands in the prep room, so
# nothing but the cat can hurt them: a husk's health going down is the cat's doing.
# play-timeout: 900
@intent a creature wished into the arena fights the wave's mobs by itself, though it is a cat
@world flat seed=1

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 900 4 true
scoreboard objectives add pt_h0 dummy
scoreboard objectives add pt_h1 dummy

@step a cat on the arena floor, made in prep
# he opens the gate in the shared wall and walks through it, into the arena, as in 7-creature-in-the-arena
@aim pos 0.5 64.5 16.5
@key key.use
@wait 10t
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 45t
@wait 10t
@assert execute if entity @s[z=-15,dz=29]
@aim look 180 12
@wait 2s
moddy apprentice a cat
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /is ready/ within 90s
@wait 3s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:cat,x=-15,y=60,z=-15,dx=30,dy=12,dz=30]
@shot the-cat-in-the-arena

@step back in the prep room, he presses the start button
# SHORTCUT: he is put back in the prep room beside the start button (walking back is not what the step tests)
tp @s 2.5 64 20.5 180 0
@wait 1s
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 20s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:husk,tag=moddyarena_wave]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:cat,x=-15,y=60,z=-15,dx=30,dy=12,dz=30]
# each husk's health as it came in (tenths of a point)
execute as @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] store result score @s pt_h0 run data get entity @s Health 10

@step the cat fights the husks: one of them loses health, and he has struck nothing
@repeat 40 until execute as @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] if score @s pt_h1 < @s pt_h0
@wait 1s
execute as @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] store result score @s pt_h1 run data get entity @s Health 10
@end-repeat
@assert execute as @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] if score @s pt_h1 < @s pt_h0
@shot the-cat-fights
